1
00:00:02,190 --> 00:00:05,110
Hey! You got oshiruko all over me!

2
00:00:05,110 --> 00:00:06,950
That stuff ain't fit to eat!

3
00:00:06,950 --> 00:00:08,740
Might as well cover yourself in it!

4
00:00:10,490 --> 00:00:12,620
Bring out more soup!

5
00:00:12,620 --> 00:00:14,290
Let's have a food fight!

6
00:00:14,290 --> 00:00:16,450
Spill it all!

7
00:00:22,960 --> 00:00:25,090
Why?!

8
00:00:25,090 --> 00:00:28,050
What the hell's wrong with you idiots?!

9
00:00:28,470 --> 00:00:31,430
Why do you get all this food?!

10
00:02:05,770 --> 00:02:07,940
Battle Music

11
00:02:16,990 --> 00:02:18,950
What's he doing?!

12
00:02:18,950 --> 00:02:21,750
Is red bean soup that good?!

13
00:02:27,710 --> 00:02:30,460
Yeah, it's delicious.

14
00:02:30,460 --> 00:02:32,800
Nothing else even comes close.

15
00:02:41,520 --> 00:02:42,520
So how come...

16
00:02:42,520 --> 00:02:46,480
you guys get to waste it
while Tama goes hungry?!

17
00:03:05,370 --> 00:03:07,750
Gum-Gum...

18
00:03:09,040 --> 00:03:11,750
Elephant Gun!

19
00:03:37,280 --> 00:03:38,990
Captain, look!

20
00:03:43,330 --> 00:03:44,580
It's Straw Hat!

21
00:03:44,580 --> 00:03:47,250
What does that moron think he's doing?!

22
00:03:47,250 --> 00:03:52,880
We disguised ourselves to sneak
through the banquet hall...

23
00:03:52,880 --> 00:03:55,090
Oh, well...

24
00:03:55,090 --> 00:03:55,920
Kid?

25
00:03:55,920 --> 00:03:57,380
Leave him!

26
00:03:57,380 --> 00:04:02,850
While they're focused on
that idiot, we'll slip right by.

27
00:04:12,730 --> 00:04:14,150
What the...?!

28
00:04:44,010 --> 00:04:45,730
Seriously...

29
00:04:46,770 --> 00:04:48,940
You just had to cause a scene!

30
00:04:50,980 --> 00:04:54,320
I made a beeline for the source...

31
00:04:55,730 --> 00:04:58,240
but you've already ruined everything!

32
00:04:58,670 --> 00:05:03,160
Why the hell can't you just sneak in quietly?!

33
00:05:03,160 --> 00:05:04,700
Really?

34
00:05:04,700 --> 00:05:07,500
Does he hear himself right now?

35
00:05:11,290 --> 00:05:13,670
These jerks had it coming!

36
00:05:15,880 --> 00:05:19,050
They were dumping oshiruko for fun!

37
00:05:19,800 --> 00:05:21,180
Oshiruko?!

38
00:05:21,180 --> 00:05:25,510
This soup is so delicious!

39
00:05:26,930 --> 00:05:30,180
In that case, I'll cut them to ribbons!

40
00:05:36,770 --> 00:05:38,900
What kind of surprise is this?

41
00:05:41,860 --> 00:05:43,870
Oshiruko?

42
00:05:43,870 --> 00:05:45,660
Why would that set them off?

43
00:05:46,410 --> 00:05:48,120
Those guys are hopeless.

44
00:05:48,120 --> 00:05:49,700
I can't work with them.

45
00:05:50,870 --> 00:05:53,670
Man, we really stepped in it.

46
00:05:55,000 --> 00:05:58,880
But it's not time to start the battle yet.

47
00:05:58,880 --> 00:06:02,840
I know, but they haven't
figured out who we are yet.

48
00:06:03,260 --> 00:06:05,260
So... Happy now?

49
00:06:05,800 --> 00:06:06,640
Yeah!

50
00:06:07,260 --> 00:06:08,510
Then...

51
00:06:08,510 --> 00:06:09,810
let's beat it!

52
00:06:09,810 --> 00:06:10,730
Okay!

53
00:06:10,730 --> 00:06:12,520
They're making a run for it!

54
00:06:15,150 --> 00:06:16,900
Catch them!

55
00:06:17,360 --> 00:06:18,980
Hey, now...

56
00:06:18,980 --> 00:06:21,190
What's with all the commotion?

57
00:06:25,410 --> 00:06:26,780
Don't tell me...

58
00:06:26,780 --> 00:06:28,200
Are they...?

59
00:06:36,170 --> 00:06:38,040
A-pow-pow! Yo, check it out!

60
00:06:39,420 --> 00:06:43,010
Yo, Queen! I got the scoop
of the century! It'll blow you away!

61
00:06:43,010 --> 00:06:44,220
So listen up, okay?!

62
00:06:44,220 --> 00:06:45,750
Okay, Apoo!

63
00:06:45,750 --> 00:06:46,890
Apoo! Apoo!

64
00:06:46,890 --> 00:06:49,100
Don't be an ass! Share the news with the class!

65
00:06:49,100 --> 00:06:52,060
Brother Apoo! Gimme a nice rhyme, 'poo!

66
00:06:53,730 --> 00:06:55,440
That voice...

67
00:06:57,020 --> 00:06:58,360
Check it out!

68
00:06:58,360 --> 00:07:02,860
Udon's labor camps? That's your domain!
Trying to break out? It'll be in vain!

69
00:07:04,610 --> 00:07:07,160
Once you're inside, you're trapped like a rat!

70
00:07:09,830 --> 00:07:12,160
But check out those two!
What's up with that?!

71
00:07:16,290 --> 00:07:17,460
Oh, should we fight?

72
00:07:19,960 --> 00:07:22,670
Now that I look closely at that duo raising hell,

73
00:07:22,670 --> 00:07:25,300
those jailbreakers down
there are ringing a bell!

74
00:07:32,520 --> 00:07:33,720
No way!

75
00:07:49,200 --> 00:07:51,580
Yes way! You ain't trippin', yo!

76
00:07:56,000 --> 00:08:00,710
It's Straw Hat Luffy and Pirate Hunter Zoro!

77
00:08:03,800 --> 00:08:06,170
So he broke out of the prison...

78
00:08:06,170 --> 00:08:10,260
This is Warden Babanuki in Udon.

79
00:08:10,590 --> 00:08:12,970
So, all is well.

80
00:08:18,480 --> 00:08:21,310
Tonight, we're celebrating the Golden Festival!

81
00:08:21,690 --> 00:08:25,280
So catch them as a gift for me!

82
00:08:26,780 --> 00:08:28,820
Hey, Queen!

83
00:08:28,820 --> 00:08:31,660
What's the prize for bringing them to you?

84
00:08:31,660 --> 00:08:36,290
Well, it just so happens
there's someone I want to axe...

85
00:08:38,830 --> 00:08:41,040
from the Soaring Six!

86
00:09:08,860 --> 00:09:14,280
Whoever catches these rats
for me can have the vacant spot!

87
00:09:20,710 --> 00:09:22,250
The Soaring Six, huh?

88
00:09:22,250 --> 00:09:25,290
Now that's my kind of reward!

89
00:09:27,840 --> 00:09:29,760
That spot is as good as mine!

90
00:09:32,510 --> 00:09:34,350
Apoo!

91
00:09:38,810 --> 00:09:40,890
That must be Kaido's castle back there!

92
00:09:40,890 --> 00:09:43,440
Let's clear a path and get inside!

93
00:09:43,440 --> 00:09:44,310
Sure!

94
00:09:59,330 --> 00:10:02,040
These guys seem like a real pain!

95
00:10:02,040 --> 00:10:03,210
What's their deal?

96
00:10:03,540 --> 00:10:07,040
They must be the ones that ate SMILE fruits!

97
00:10:24,400 --> 00:10:27,400
Check out my battle music!

98
00:10:27,400 --> 00:10:28,230
Scratch!

99
00:10:28,940 --> 00:10:29,610
Bop!

100
00:10:38,160 --> 00:10:38,780
Luffy!

101
00:10:39,200 --> 00:10:40,950
What the...?! Something punched me?!

102
00:10:46,170 --> 00:10:49,420
That guy was in an alliance with Jaggy's crew...

103
00:10:51,630 --> 00:10:52,720
Slash!

104
00:10:54,680 --> 00:10:55,430
Zoro!

105
00:10:55,430 --> 00:10:56,800
I got cut?!

106
00:11:00,010 --> 00:11:02,270
But he doesn't have a blade!

107
00:11:02,270 --> 00:11:04,480
I didn't see an attack either...!

108
00:11:05,600 --> 00:11:07,610
What kind of ability does he have?

109
00:11:12,280 --> 00:11:13,190
Boom!

110
00:11:16,820 --> 00:11:17,780
Luffy!

111
00:11:17,780 --> 00:11:20,370
Ch-Ch-Ch-Ch... Check it out!

112
00:11:21,990 --> 00:11:24,500
Whoa, whoa, gimme a break!

113
00:11:24,500 --> 00:11:26,170
That was too easy!

114
00:11:32,760 --> 00:11:35,050
It's no use! We gotta get out of here!

115
00:11:35,050 --> 00:11:36,760
Hey, you guys!

116
00:11:36,760 --> 00:11:40,510
Don't let them get away!

117
00:11:40,510 --> 00:11:45,480
If you want that spot in
the Soaring Six, you gotta work for it!

118
00:11:46,890 --> 00:11:49,400
If we take a bad beating here...

119
00:11:53,780 --> 00:11:56,280
we won't be able to knock out Kaido!

120
00:11:56,280 --> 00:11:59,030
As expected, it's not just their numbers.

121
00:11:59,990 --> 00:12:02,080
They're pretty tough!

122
00:12:02,080 --> 00:12:04,500
Soaring Six, here I come!

123
00:12:10,080 --> 00:12:11,170
Sorry.

124
00:12:11,170 --> 00:12:12,800
I'm all good now.

125
00:12:13,340 --> 00:12:14,920
Of course you are.

126
00:12:14,920 --> 00:12:17,840
Guess these disguises are kinda pointless now.

127
00:12:17,840 --> 00:12:19,130
You're right.

128
00:12:19,130 --> 00:12:21,100
It's hard to fight in them, too.

129
00:12:21,100 --> 00:12:22,970
Alright!

130
00:12:25,100 --> 00:12:28,190
We're done hiding! Let's
hurry up and break through!

131
00:12:28,730 --> 00:12:30,400
Right!

132
00:12:30,850 --> 00:12:32,310
It's no use.

133
00:12:32,310 --> 00:12:35,610
You guys are in my range.

134
00:12:35,610 --> 00:12:36,860
Check it out!

135
00:12:37,650 --> 00:12:39,110
What can we do?

136
00:12:39,860 --> 00:12:40,740
Scratch!

137
00:12:45,290 --> 00:12:46,580
Don't do it, Kid!

138
00:12:46,580 --> 00:12:48,580
You'll blow our cover, too!

139
00:13:00,680 --> 00:13:03,180
I don't give a damn!

140
00:13:08,930 --> 00:13:12,900
That double-crossing son of a bitch...!

141
00:13:14,650 --> 00:13:18,360
Everything is all his fault!

142
00:13:23,320 --> 00:13:25,910
Go to hell, Apoo!

143
00:13:25,910 --> 00:13:27,370
Kid!

144
00:13:27,700 --> 00:13:29,830
Punk...

145
00:13:35,880 --> 00:13:38,260
Gibson!

146
00:13:52,270 --> 00:13:54,270
Oh, Jaggy!

147
00:13:54,270 --> 00:13:55,690
That dummy!

148
00:13:59,150 --> 00:14:00,570
Apoo!

149
00:14:00,570 --> 00:14:02,950
Hey, that guy's an impostor!

150
00:14:16,630 --> 00:14:19,510
What?!

151
00:14:19,840 --> 00:14:21,300
Don't tell me...!

152
00:14:21,300 --> 00:14:22,420
Is that...?!

153
00:14:27,050 --> 00:14:30,470
It's Captain Kid!

154
00:14:34,850 --> 00:14:37,770
What the hell is Kid doing here?

155
00:14:37,770 --> 00:14:40,690
He's supposed to be locked up in Udon, too!

156
00:14:40,690 --> 00:14:45,360
You better have a damn good
explanation for this, Babanuki!

157
00:14:56,960 --> 00:15:01,170
You were so eager to form an alliance...

158
00:15:03,050 --> 00:15:04,630
Back then...

159
00:15:04,760 --> 00:15:07,390
I should've put it together!

160
00:15:10,510 --> 00:15:14,270
You were already one of Kaido's informants!

161
00:15:14,270 --> 00:15:18,060
Kaido knew every move that we made...

162
00:15:18,690 --> 00:15:22,150
because you were reporting to him, right?!

163
00:15:25,820 --> 00:15:28,120
You're just a kid after all!

164
00:15:28,120 --> 00:15:29,160
What?!

165
00:15:29,160 --> 00:15:35,080
Did you think our alliance was strong enough
to take down one of the Four Emperors?!

166
00:15:35,080 --> 00:15:36,920
Get real!

167
00:15:39,590 --> 00:15:42,170
After all, when have you ever heard...

168
00:15:42,170 --> 00:15:45,470
of a pirate alliance having a happy ending?!

169
00:15:45,470 --> 00:15:46,380
Scratch!

170
00:15:47,180 --> 00:15:49,220
Slash!

171
00:15:49,920 --> 00:15:51,680
SLASH

172
00:16:02,230 --> 00:16:05,030
I thought you were dead...

173
00:16:05,360 --> 00:16:07,780
Well, Kid?

174
00:16:09,530 --> 00:16:10,780
You scum!

175
00:16:10,780 --> 00:16:11,990
Queen!

176
00:16:11,990 --> 00:16:14,700
They're running wild!

177
00:16:16,000 --> 00:16:19,460
How are we supposed
to catch them alive like this?!

178
00:16:21,080 --> 00:16:22,710
Who said you couldn't kill 'em?

179
00:16:30,890 --> 00:16:32,390
Repel!

180
00:16:38,020 --> 00:16:40,560
Anyone with a death wish, step right up!

181
00:16:41,060 --> 00:16:43,320
I'll be your executioner!

182
00:16:47,070 --> 00:16:48,200
There he is!

183
00:16:48,200 --> 00:16:49,910
I knew Killer would be here too!

184
00:17:05,170 --> 00:17:07,840
Kid! Let's get out of here!

185
00:17:09,590 --> 00:17:12,300
There's nothing to gain
from fighting them here!

186
00:17:13,010 --> 00:17:14,930
I guess you've got a point...

187
00:17:21,770 --> 00:17:23,440
Hey, stop!

188
00:17:23,440 --> 00:17:26,530
Even if you kill them,
you can't be part of the Soaring Six!

189
00:17:41,710 --> 00:17:42,870
Whoa, whoa, quit it!

190
00:17:42,870 --> 00:17:44,040
You'll hurt us, too!

191
00:17:53,390 --> 00:17:54,970
Get out of here!

192
00:17:56,220 --> 00:17:58,890
Somebody, stop him!

193
00:18:00,230 --> 00:18:02,690
I guess that's my cue...

194
00:18:02,690 --> 00:18:04,480
Time to scram!

195
00:18:05,110 --> 00:18:08,480
Seems like they can't control
that guy! But who is he?!

196
00:18:09,070 --> 00:18:12,400
A giant? No, he's way too big!

197
00:18:26,750 --> 00:18:30,170
Haccha
One of the Numbers

198
00:18:30,170 --> 00:18:31,840
Attaboy, Haccha!

199
00:18:42,350 --> 00:18:45,730
Looks like I'll be taking Kid's head!

200
00:18:58,410 --> 00:19:00,740
Jaggy! Let's make a dash for the castle!

201
00:19:11,130 --> 00:19:12,380
Man...

202
00:19:12,800 --> 00:19:16,300
I knew you'd start something, Jaggy!

203
00:19:16,300 --> 00:19:19,010
Look who's talking, Luffy!

204
00:19:19,930 --> 00:19:21,640
You're just as bad, Roronoa!

205
00:19:22,850 --> 00:19:24,520
They're all hopeless.

206
00:19:26,270 --> 00:19:28,310
Yay!

207
00:19:28,310 --> 00:19:33,610
Once I break out my battle
music, there's no escape!

208
00:19:33,610 --> 00:19:35,150
Here we go!

209
00:19:35,150 --> 00:19:37,320
Encore! Check it out!

210
00:19:38,160 --> 00:19:40,740
Hey! Cover your ears!

211
00:19:40,740 --> 00:19:41,910
Check it out!

212
00:19:41,910 --> 00:19:43,790
Boom!

213
00:19:43,950 --> 00:19:44,620
BOOM

214
00:20:08,730 --> 00:20:10,020
Listen up, guys!

215
00:20:11,020 --> 00:20:12,770
Apoo attacks using sound itself!

216
00:20:12,770 --> 00:20:16,740
If you can hear the attack,
it's already too late to dodge!

217
00:20:17,200 --> 00:20:18,700
So keep an eye on him!

218
00:20:20,530 --> 00:20:21,240
– What?
– What?

219
00:20:22,410 --> 00:20:25,790
Since it's so important,
I'll say it one more time!

220
00:20:25,790 --> 00:20:26,620
Okay!

221
00:20:31,290 --> 00:20:33,750
They finally contacted me!

222
00:20:33,750 --> 00:20:38,050
They said the ship was fine,
so they should be here soon!

223
00:20:38,050 --> 00:20:39,380
How curious...

224
00:20:39,380 --> 00:20:41,970
Are you sure, Big Mom?

225
00:20:42,760 --> 00:20:47,140
There's been no word of new
arrivals from Mogura Port...

226
00:20:48,730 --> 00:20:50,270
Port?

227
00:20:50,730 --> 00:20:52,690
There's a port?

228
00:20:53,270 --> 00:20:54,650
Huh...?!

229
00:20:55,320 --> 00:20:58,530
Meanwhile, the eastern forces led by Kin'emon

230
00:20:58,110 --> 00:21:01,570
Present
Location

231
00:20:58,530 --> 00:21:01,570
approach the back entrance
of the castle as planned.

232
00:21:01,570 --> 00:21:02,990
My fellow warriors!

233
00:21:02,990 --> 00:21:05,740
Before we proceed,
I would like to modify our plan!

234
00:21:06,330 --> 00:21:11,330
It would seem that as of now,
they are still ignorant of our arrival!

235
00:21:11,330 --> 00:21:14,590
So let us split our forces once more!

236
00:21:16,000 --> 00:21:20,550
Half of us will infiltrate
the Skull Dome from the side,

237
00:21:16,960 --> 00:21:30,890
Present
Location

238
00:21:20,550 --> 00:21:24,300
slipping into the enemy's midst
and waiting for the moment to strike.

239
00:21:24,300 --> 00:21:27,810
Meanwhile the other half will
sneak in through the back door.

240
00:21:27,810 --> 00:21:30,890
There we will ambush Kaido and Orochi from both sides!

241
00:21:31,650 --> 00:21:33,900
I'm on the edge of my seat!

242
00:21:33,900 --> 00:21:35,820
I wonder if Momo will be there.

243
00:21:39,030 --> 00:21:44,530
The samurai inch ever closer to
the castle where Orochi and Kaido reside.

244
00:21:49,790 --> 00:21:50,540
Halt!

245
00:21:51,080 --> 00:21:55,630
There was, however, a miscalculation.

246
00:21:55,630 --> 00:21:57,130
I see.

247
00:21:57,130 --> 00:22:00,130
The blueprints for the mansion were quite old.

248
00:22:00,130 --> 00:22:02,590
It is no surprise there have been additions.

249
00:22:02,590 --> 00:22:08,430
Building: "Sweet Entanglement"

250
00:22:03,260 --> 00:22:08,430
But it is far too conspicuous
for 2,000 soldiers to cross such a bridge!

251
00:22:11,270 --> 00:22:13,520
Hey, Kin'emon...

252
00:22:15,480 --> 00:22:18,440
Is... Is... Is...

253
00:22:18,440 --> 00:22:22,280
Is that a pleasure hall I see over there?!

254
00:22:22,280 --> 00:22:27,580
This pleasure hall is owned by
Black Maria, one of the Soaring Six.

255
00:22:32,910 --> 00:22:36,710
I bet there are tons of lovely ladies in there!

256
00:22:36,710 --> 00:22:38,590
Oh, Sanji!

257
00:22:39,130 --> 00:22:41,920
Wait, Sir Sanji!

258
00:22:43,130 --> 00:22:45,760
It's like he's being sucked in!

259
00:22:46,300 --> 00:22:48,930
We're gonna sneak in, too!

260
00:22:48,930 --> 00:22:52,560
We shall form a search team
for Lord Momonosuke!

261
00:22:52,560 --> 00:22:55,270
You've been super worried about him!

262
00:22:55,650 --> 00:22:57,060
Just admit it!

263
00:23:03,360 --> 00:23:06,410
Just leave Momo's rescue to us!

264
00:23:08,120 --> 00:23:12,000
That way you guys can focus on the fight!

265
00:23:12,330 --> 00:23:15,620
Lady Nami! Lady Carrot! Shinobu!

266
00:23:18,590 --> 00:23:20,710
You have my utmost gratitude!

267
00:23:20,710 --> 00:23:22,710
In truth, it has been weighing on me!

268
00:23:23,380 --> 00:23:24,630
I am counting on you!

269
00:23:28,430 --> 00:23:31,220
Someone's coming out of the pleasure hall!

270
00:23:33,270 --> 00:23:34,180
Is that...?

271
00:23:37,310 --> 00:23:39,980
Guess he didn't find any girls...

272
00:23:41,730 --> 00:23:46,280
After hearing the commotion
that Luffy and the others created,

273
00:23:46,280 --> 00:23:50,660
almost all of Kaido and Orochi's
subordinates have left the pleasure hall...

274
00:23:52,700 --> 00:23:54,200
Invaders!

275
00:23:54,200 --> 00:23:55,830
Catch them!

276
00:23:55,830 --> 00:23:57,210
Take them down!

277
00:24:10,470 --> 00:24:11,640
It's Killer!

278
00:24:14,470 --> 00:24:16,980
Hey! Hey! Hey!

279
00:24:17,440 --> 00:24:18,900
Yo! Yo!

280
00:24:18,900 --> 00:24:21,150
What's taking so long?

281
00:24:21,150 --> 00:24:23,610
That guy's not that strong!

282
00:24:25,320 --> 00:24:27,360
Did you guys know?

283
00:24:27,360 --> 00:24:29,950
Killer ate a defective SMILE fruit,

284
00:24:29,950 --> 00:24:34,370
and became a Pleasure!

285
00:24:36,410 --> 00:24:38,500
Hey, Killer!

286
00:24:38,500 --> 00:24:43,130
If you eat this, I'll give you
a chance to save your captain!

287
00:24:49,220 --> 00:24:51,180
What the hell's so funny?!

288
00:24:53,600 --> 00:24:55,890
You bastards!

289
00:25:02,810 --> 00:25:07,150
I'll send everyone who laughs at you to hell!

290
00:25:07,940 --> 00:25:09,030
That so?

291
00:25:11,780 --> 00:25:13,830
Hey, Jaggy!

292
00:25:13,830 --> 00:25:15,950
Don't cause any more trouble!

293
00:25:19,830 --> 00:25:23,330
So they broke out of Udon's prison...

294
00:25:23,330 --> 00:25:24,670
Should we go after them?

295
00:25:24,670 --> 00:25:26,550
Wouldn't hurt to get the credit...

296
00:25:26,960 --> 00:25:28,090
Forget it!

297
00:25:28,090 --> 00:25:29,920
It's just a few rats.

298
00:25:30,430 --> 00:25:33,970
Focus on finding Yamato for me instead!

299
00:25:33,970 --> 00:25:36,600
That's a much bigger deal.

300
00:25:37,270 --> 00:25:39,480
Do not let Sasaki beat us to the punch!

301
00:25:39,480 --> 00:25:40,480
Yes, sir!

302
00:25:44,440 --> 00:25:47,400
What's the holdup?! Ice these rejects, yo!

303
00:25:47,400 --> 00:25:50,200
Put 'em in a grave six feet below!

304
00:25:52,110 --> 00:25:53,160
In any case...

305
00:25:53,910 --> 00:25:56,660
I can't believe what Queen said...

306
00:26:00,040 --> 00:26:02,040
I've been wanting...

307
00:26:04,750 --> 00:26:06,630
to kill someone myself.

308
00:26:09,210 --> 00:26:12,050
If the women left, the men weren't far behind.

309
00:26:12,590 --> 00:26:14,340
It appears we can cross after all!

310
00:26:15,800 --> 00:26:18,430
Live floor infiltration team, good luck!

311
00:26:18,430 --> 00:26:19,930
– Yeah!
– Yeah!

312
00:26:21,020 --> 00:26:23,100
Nice! That's the spirit, guys!

313
00:26:23,810 --> 00:26:25,690
The rest of you, follow me!

314
00:26:25,690 --> 00:26:28,190
– Yeah!
– Yeah!

315
00:26:29,860 --> 00:26:32,650
Gunner and driver Usopp,

316
00:26:32,650 --> 00:26:38,080
move Brachio-Tank 5 ahead slowly,
matching speed with the infantry!

317
00:26:38,740 --> 00:26:42,460
Roger that, tank commander Chopper!

318
00:26:42,790 --> 00:26:44,290
Proceeding nice and slow!

319
00:26:48,500 --> 00:26:53,340
Keep an eye on the windows
of the pleasure hall just in case!

320
00:26:53,340 --> 00:26:54,340
Leave it to me!

321
00:26:56,300 --> 00:26:58,810
If you should see a silhouette…

322
00:26:59,560 --> 00:27:00,720
Kin'emon!

323
00:27:00,720 --> 00:27:03,060
What's all that racket outside?

324
00:27:04,100 --> 00:27:06,400
Everyone, into the water!

325
00:27:23,120 --> 00:27:24,080
What?!

326
00:27:37,390 --> 00:27:42,470
The Falls
Outside
of Wano

327
00:27:44,020 --> 00:27:46,020
Let's go, Brothers and Sisters!

328
00:27:46,020 --> 00:27:47,900
– Yeah!
– Yeah!

329
00:27:47,900 --> 00:27:49,560
King...

330
00:27:49,560 --> 00:27:53,320
I'll get even with that bastard
if it's the lickety last thing I do!

331
00:27:53,320 --> 00:27:55,450
Climb all the way to the top!

332
00:27:55,450 --> 00:27:57,950
But why the hell is this the only way in?!

333
00:27:57,950 --> 00:27:59,820
It's absolutely absurd!

334
00:28:00,160 --> 00:28:05,710
No, what's absurd is the Big Mom Pirates
allying with the Beast Pirates!

335
00:28:05,710 --> 00:28:08,330
It has to be a joke!

336
00:28:08,330 --> 00:28:10,250
What is Mama thinking?!

337
00:28:10,250 --> 00:28:12,460
Mama's made her decision!

338
00:28:12,460 --> 00:28:14,710
Forget about the alliance!

339
00:28:14,710 --> 00:28:17,680
Remember the reason we actually came!

340
00:28:17,680 --> 00:28:18,840
You're right!

341
00:28:18,840 --> 00:28:23,350
In order to restore our reputation,
we need to find Straw Hat, kill him...

342
00:28:23,350 --> 00:28:26,310
...and display his head for the world to see!

343
00:28:27,310 --> 00:28:28,940
How barbaric!

344
00:28:28,940 --> 00:28:30,900
More importantly...

345
00:28:31,480 --> 00:28:35,610
I can become Kaido's new favorite!

346
00:28:35,610 --> 00:28:37,570
Screw you, Flampe!

347
00:28:37,570 --> 00:28:39,360
We made it!

348
00:28:39,990 --> 00:28:41,030
Wano!

349
00:28:41,030 --> 00:28:43,580
We don't know what's out there!

350
00:28:43,580 --> 00:28:44,870
Prepare to fight!

351
00:28:46,500 --> 00:28:48,210
Don't drop your guard!

352
00:28:48,210 --> 00:28:52,500
Last time, at this very place, that damn King...

353
00:28:54,210 --> 00:28:55,090
That's...!

354
00:28:55,420 --> 00:28:57,840
What?! King?!

355
00:28:57,840 --> 00:28:59,670
That bastard came back–

356
00:29:00,590 --> 00:29:02,050
No, that's not him!

357
00:29:03,640 --> 00:29:04,760
Marco?!

358
00:29:04,640 --> 00:29:07,060
Marco "the Phoenix"
Former First Division Commander
of the Whitebeard Pirates

359
00:29:06,350 --> 00:29:07,060
Hmm...

360
00:29:07,430 --> 00:29:12,440
So the rumor about the Big Mom Pirates
and the Beast Pirates' alliance...

361
00:29:12,440 --> 00:29:14,320
wasn't just talk.

362
00:29:25,540 --> 00:29:26,450
Now...

363
00:29:28,450 --> 00:29:29,620
back down you go!

364
00:29:30,790 --> 00:29:33,670
Phoenix Brand!

365
00:29:33,670 --> 00:29:35,880
Not on my watch!

366
00:29:41,720 --> 00:29:43,680
You've got to be kidding me!

367
00:29:43,680 --> 00:29:45,260
– Again?!
– Again?!

368
00:29:50,020 --> 00:29:53,400
Why is he here?!

369
00:29:53,400 --> 00:29:57,230
The next time you make it up to Wano,

370
00:29:57,230 --> 00:29:59,900
you may find things are slightly different.

371
00:30:02,910 --> 00:30:04,070
Huh?!

372
00:30:04,070 --> 00:30:06,530
A big ship is falling meowt of the sky!

373
00:30:06,870 --> 00:30:07,700
Look up there.

374
00:30:12,000 --> 00:30:13,790
Haven't seen that mug...

375
00:30:13,790 --> 00:30:16,040
since the war.

376
00:30:16,040 --> 00:30:17,380
Marco.
